Description: Export hip_finish_pinfo used by the frontend
 hip_finish_pinfo is implemented and used from frontend/get_audio.c, but was
 omitted from include/libmp3lame.sym. With -export-symbols / version-script
 linking, dynamic frontends then fail to resolve it.
 (UTF-8 ID3 helpers are already exported in LAME 4.0.)

--- a/include/libmp3lame.sym
+++ b/include/libmp3lame.sym
@@ -193,6 +193,7 @@
 hip_decode1
 hip_decode1_headers
 hip_decode1_headersB
+hip_finish_pinfo
 lame_decode_init
 lame_decode
 lame_decode_headers
